Package: electrocpue
Title: Electrofishing Catch-Per-Unit-Effort Analyzer
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Travis", "Shepherd",
           email = "shepherd70@gmail.com",
           role  = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for analyzing multi-pass electrofishing data,
    including input validation, assumption-aware population estimation
    via Zippin and Carle-Strub depletion methods, effort standardization
    for raw and amp-based shocking, and tidy reach-level density and
    catch-per-unit-effort summaries with confidence intervals.
